    "result_text": "The suite is green \u2014 `AcceptanceTest` is the only test in the project and it passes. The build compiles cleanly (DTOs are regenerated from `openapi.yml` during the build).\n\n## Summary\n\nThe spec required the API to return `selfLink = \"/api/owners/\" + <owner id>`. The `OwnerDto` is generated from `openapi.yml` and populated by MapStruct in `OwnerMapper`, and both the POST (create) and GET responses flow through `OwnerMapper.toOwnerDto`, so I fixed it in that one place:\n\n1. **`src/main/resources/openapi.yml`** \u2014 added a `selfLink` (read-only string) property to the `Owner` schema, so the generated `OwnerDto` has the field.\n\n2. **`src/main/java/.../mapper/OwnerMapper.java`** \u2014 added `@Mapping(target = \"selfLink\", expression = \"java(selfLink(owner))\")` plus a `selfLink(Owner)` helper returning `\"/api/owners/\" + owner.getId()` (null when the owner has no id).\n\nThe test creates an owner and then does `GET /api/owners/{id}`, asserting `$.selfLink == \"/api/owners/\" + id` \u2014 now green.",
